Copy the contents of sdcard/ to the FAT32 SD root. Required: doom/doom1.wad (runtime /sdcard/doom/doom1.wad). License and credits accompany the separate SD assets.␀␀WORKER_BEGIN␀␀␀␀Validating assets...␀␀␀␀Not enough PSRAM: need 6 MiB contiguous + overhead.␀INIT_BEGIN␀␀INIT_END␀␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: ENGINE_STARTED state_bytes=%lu
␀Running - SFX only␀␀ENGINE_MEMORY␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: ENGINE_STACK owner_hwm=%u
␀␀Engine fault: %.120s␀␀␀␀WORKER_CLEAN␀␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: ENGINE_JOIN_READY frames=%lu dropped=%lu owned=%lu
␀I (%lu) %s: NATIVE_TAKEOVER rotation=270 period_ms=%u owner_priority=%u PCM=3 engine=2 drained=1
␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: NATIVE_PRESENT interval_ms=%lu completed_viewports=%lu failed_viewports=%lu completed_total=%lu owner_priority=%u block_ticks=%u
␀␀␀Stopping - waiting for engine cleanup...␀␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: EXIT_REQUESTED
␀Game boot - intent already consumed␀SD unavailable / missing WAD. Return CYM reboots.

